Description:
Since 1984, CONTRÔLES RL specializes in the manufacturing of industrial automation systems.

We provide integrated products to meet each of our customer's specific needs. The solutions are based on leading-edge technology and first quality components and all this, following customer's specifications.

Accomplishing this mission, Contrôles RL count on close collaboration with the customer in order to finish with a product that reflect exactly the customer's needs.

Certifications:  CSA, UL, ULC, Explosion Proof, CE, ISO 9001-:2008

Contrôles RL offers the following services :

· Engineering, fabrication, assembly and set-up of industrial automation and process control systems.
· Engineering, development, integration and set-up of technical solutions designed to comply to each customer’s needs & requirements.
· Modifications and/or update of existing automation and process control systems.
· After sales support and customer training.

We are active in the following general industrial fields:

· Programmable logic controls;
· Motor control systems;  Variable frequency drives;
· Motion control systems;
· Pneumatic controls;
· Explosion proof systems and environment.

More specifically:

· Industrial burner management systems;
· Surveillance and security supervision systems;
· Water treatment;
· Aluminum and steel plants and Mines;
· Chemical,  Petrochemical and Refinery plants.

Service Ultratronic is located in the Beauharnois industrial.
In our new location we have spacious room that houses professional offices and production machines at the cutting edge of technology.
Having more than 15 years experience, certified IPC-A-610D, we can provide you with a high quality product in a short time and at reasonable prices. We are currently working with several clients very well known in the field, who are very satisfied with our services and we would like to expand our horizons to the maximum benefit of our companies expertise.

Our Services:
· Complete design of circuits;
· Service assembling key-in-hand;
· Department of emergency assembly;
· Setting housings;
· Calibration and testing;
· Repair Service after sale
· Support Service engineering specifications, samples, equivalent;
· Feasibility Study
· Purchase of components (small and large quantities);
· Assembly of small and large quantities;
· Assembly manual through-hole (through-hole);
· Surface Mount, robotic or manual;
· Wave soldering and manual soldering;
· Manual assembly of prototypes;
· Purchase all kinds of PCB (double or multilayers)

EP-TECH " www.ep-tech.ca " " involves in manufacturing of corrosion control equipment such as Hexlogger (GPS Data Logger CIPS and DCVG), GPS Synchronized Smart Data logger, High voltage Holiday Detector, Analog DCVG Holiday Detector, Soil Test Resistance Meter, GPS Synchronized Current Interrupter, Pipeline locator, PCR, SSD and many more. The Customs HS Commodity Code for this equipment is 9030.31 

EP-TECH production and services meet all standards, regulations, and requirements such as CSA (Canadian Standard Approve), NIST (National Institute of Standards), NRC (National Research council of Canada). We obey the NACE standards (National Association of corrosion Engineer) rules, regulations, logics and standards in manufacturing our equipment.

E-mail: sales@ep-tech.ca;

Desdowd est un représentant de manufacturiers commercialisant des produits destinés au marché de la distribution électrique et électronique.

Notre mission est d’offrir, de façon distinctive, une représentation de qualité aux manufacturiers que nous représentons en adaptant nos techniques à l’évolution des marchés.

Desdowd, fondé en 1967, compte 24 employés dont 11 représentants. L’entreprise possède des bureaux à Montréal, Québec et Ottawa et se distingue par la stabilité des relations avec les manufacturiers qu’elle représente; certains sont des partenaires depuis sa fondation. L’entreprise a comme modus operandi :

- D’avoir une équipe de représentants de haut niveau présente sur l’entièreté du territoire québécois ainsi que dans la région d’Ottawa ;
- D’établir et d’entretenir des relations d’affaire de qualité avec le réseau de distribution électrique et électronique;
- De couvrir tous les segments de marché;
- D’accorder une importance majeure à la spécification au niveau des designers, architectes et ingénieurs-conseils ;
- D’adapter ses techniques à l’évolution des marchés.

Our mission is to provide electronic circuit assembly, repair, design and engineering support services. We distinguish ourselves thanks to our expertise, the quality of our work and our outstanding customer service.

Located in the L. Gerard Leclerc industrial park in St-Hubert since 1995, QMA Électronique has been able to work in partnership with its customers, to help them to fully reach their production targets.

QMA began in the agricultural electronics field. But, year after year, thanks to the invaluable support of its customers, it has seen significant growth. This has allowed it to widen its field of activities through time. Indeed, QMA has been offering its expertise, often exported to the four corners of the world, in several sectors, including telecommunications, agriculture, medicine, power stations, road signalling, road transport, and more ...

Every day, QMA Electronics seeks to improve its processes to better serve its customers. We understand the importance of doing things right the first time and we deploy all our efforts to reduce costs, defects and waste in all its forms.

Our quality objectives are to:
- Have zero defects;
- Meet or exceed all industry standards, namely IPC-A-610D and J-STD-001;
- Ship on time, every time;
- Minimize costs due to poor quality.

Our bar-code based production management system, our processes, our employees and our equipment help us reach our objectives.

Xiris Automation is a leading global manufacturer of machine vision and analytics platforms that transform welding, metal joining, and quality control across industries, combining advanced vision systems, AI tools, and expert services to optimize welding processes and drive manufacturing performance.

Our goal is to build quality products and relationships to strive to be the dominant supplier of machine vision for several niche markets globally:

- High Dynamic Range Cameras for Weld monitoring for the Global Welding industry;
- Weld Inspection systems for the Tube and Pipe industry; 
- Machine vision based Quality Control instruments for other specialty metalworking applications; 

Our mission statement at Xiris is simple - to have NO UNHAPPY CUSTOMERS!   We achieve this with an excellent engineering team and a culture that embraces continuous improvement in all our products and processes throughout the company.

Do you have a need?  Contact us:  
Telephone: +1.905.331.6660   Email: sales@xiris.com

ON NOUS CHOISIT POUR :
•notre expérience significative des projets de grande envergure, laquelle nous permet de nous conformer rigoureusement aux normes de fabrication de l’industrie;
•notre modèle d’entreprise, basé sur la flexibilité et le sur mesure, grâce auquel nous répondons adéquatement aux demandes les plus exigeantes de notre clientèle;
•notre soutien technique et notre service après-vente qui représentent pour nous une priorité;
•notre expertise et la qualité des produits qui en résulte.
